<!-- Pain Points -->
<section class="sol-section">
    <div class="sol-container">
        <div class="sol-label">Sound familiar?</div>
        <h2 class="sol-heading">Bulk retail has unique problems that generic POS systems ignore.</h2>
        <div class="pain-grid">
            <div class="pain-card">
                <div class="pain-icon">⚖️</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Weight-based sales break the system</strong>
                    <p>Your POS only handles whole units. Selling 0.75 kg of pistachios requires a workaround every time.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pain-card">
                <div class="pain-icon">🏪</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Multiple storage locations</strong>
                    <p>Back stock in the warehouse, display stock on the floor — two locations, no unified view.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pain-card">
                <div class="pain-icon">🧮</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Bulk receiving is slow</strong>
                    <p>Receiving a 25 kg bag and splitting it into per-kg pricing takes forever with manual calculations.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pain-card">
                <div class="pain-icon">📋</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Supplier tracking is a mess</strong>
                    <p>You're comparing supplier invoices across three notebooks. Reorder history is scattered everywhere.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Features -->
<section class="sol-section sol-section--alt">
    <div class="sol-container">
        <div class="sol-label">How DMD solves it</div>
        <h2 class="sol-heading">Decimal quantities, bulk pricing, unified stock — handled.</h2>
        <div class="sol-feat-grid">
            <div class="sol-feat-card">
                <div class="sol-feat-icon sol-feat-icon--amber">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 8v4l3 3"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Decimal Quantity Support</h3>
                <p>Configure products for whole or decimal units per your business type. Sell 0.5 kg, 1.25 kg, or any fractional amount — the POS and inventory handle it natively.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sol-feat-card">
                <div class="sol-feat-icon sol-feat-icon--amber">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Multi-Warehouse Stock</h3>
                <p>Track stock across your back storage, display floor, and any other location. See totals per warehouse and across all locations in a single view.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sol-feat-card">
                <div class="sol-feat-icon sol-feat-icon--amber">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"/><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Purchase Orders & Receiving</h3>
                <p>Create POs per supplier, receive bulk quantities, and let inventory update automatically. Last purchase costs are tracked so you always know your margin.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sol-feat-card">
                <div class="sol-feat-icon sol-feat-icon--amber">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Supplier Directory</h3>
                <p>Maintain a full supplier database with contact details and order history. Compare what you paid last time before placing a new order — right inside the PO screen.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sol-feat-card">
                <div class="sol-feat-icon sol-feat-icon--amber">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Bulk-Friendly POS</h3>
                <p>Search by product name, scan barcode, or browse categories. Enter decimal quantities at checkout. Full receipt printing with GST/PST automatically applied.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sol-feat-card">
                <div class="sol-feat-icon sol-feat-icon--amber">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Low Stock Alerts</h3>
                <p>Set reorder thresholds per product. Dashboard surfaces low-stock items immediately so you can place supplier orders before shelves run dry.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Quote -->
<section class="sol-section">
    <div class="sol-container sol-quote-wrap">
        <blockquote class="sol-quote sol-quote--amber">
            <p>"The decimal quantity feature alone was worth switching. We sell everything by weight and our old POS couldn't handle it. DMD just works — our cashiers figured it out in a day."</p>
            <cite>— Dry goods store owner, British Columbia</cite>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Stats -->
<section class="sol-section sol-section--alt">
    <div class="sol-container">
        <div class="stats-grid">
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-num stat-num--amber">∞</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Products supported</div>
                <div class="stat-sub">No SKU limits on Growth & Pro plans</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-num stat-num--amber">3+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Warehouses</div>
                <div class="stat-sub">Track back stock + floor stock separately</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-num stat-num--amber">0</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Manual stock updates</div>
                <div class="stat-sub">Every sale & receiving auto-syncs inventory</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Cross-links -->
<section class="sol-section">
    <div class="sol-container">
        <div class="sol-label">Other industries</div>
        <h2 class="sol-heading">See how DMD fits your specific business type.</h2>
        <div class="cross-grid">
            <a href="/retail" class="cross-card">
                <div class="cross-icon">🏪</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Retail Stores</strong>
                    <span>General & specialty retail</span>
                </div>
                <svg class="cross-arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/restaurants" class="cross-card">
                <div class="cross-icon">🍽️</div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Restaurants</strong>
                    <span>Quick-service & kitchen management</span>
                </div>
                <svg class="cross-arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Bottom CTA -->
<section class="sol-cta">
    <div class="sol-container sol-cta-inner">
        <h2>Ready to manage your bulk inventory properly?</h2>
        <p>14-day free trial. No credit card required. Set up in under an hour.</p>
        <div class="sol-cta-buttons">
            <a href="/register" class="btn-primary">Start free trial</a>
            <a href="/pricing" class="btn-secondary">View pricing</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    :root {
        --amber: #D97706; --amber-dark: #92400E; --amber-light: #FEF3C7;
        --teal: #00BFA5; --teal-dark: #00897B; --teal-light: #E0F7F4;
        --navy: #1A237E;
        --text: #1C1C1E; --text-muted: #6B7280;
        --border: #E5E7EB; --surface: #F9FAFB; --white: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .sol-hero {
        background: #FFFFFF; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 5rem 2rem 4rem;
        position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .sol-hero::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute; inset: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 55% at 50% 100%, rgba(217,119,6,0.06) 0%, transparent 65%);
        pointer-events: none;
    }
    .sol-hero-inner { position: relative; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
    .sol-hero-copy { text-align: left; }
    .sol-hero-art { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; }
    @@media (max-width: 768px) { .sol-hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .sol-hero-art { display: none; } }

    .sol-eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 0.35rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .sol-eyebrow--amber { background: var(--amber-light); color: var(--amber-dark); border: 1px solid rgba(217,119,6,0.25); }
    .sol-eyebrow-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .sol-eyebrow-dot--amber { background: var(--amber); }

    .sol-title {
        font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
        font-size: 2.75rem;
        font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    }
    .sol-sub {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 2rem;
    }
    .sol-hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    .sol-section { padding: 4rem 2rem; }
    .sol-section--alt { background: var(--surface); }
    .sol-container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }

    .sol-label {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--amber-dark); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .sol-heading {
        font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
        font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 2.5rem; max-width: 640px;
    }

    .pain-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .pain-card {
        display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem;
        background: #FFF5F5; border: 1px solid #FECACA;
        border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.25rem;
    }
    .pain-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
    .pain-card strong { display: block; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .pain-card p { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }

    .sol-feat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .sol-feat-card {
        background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 1.5rem; transition: box-shadow 0.2s, border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    }
    .sol-feat-card:hover { border-color: var(--amber); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(217,119,6,0.1); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .sol-feat-icon {
        width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .sol-feat-icon--amber { background: var(--amber-light); color: var(--amber-dark); }
    .sol-feat-card h3 { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
    .sol-feat-card p { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0; }

    .sol-quote-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
    .sol-quote {
        max-width: 680px; border-left: 4px solid; padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
        border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; background: var(--surface);
    }
    .sol-quote--amber { border-color: var(--amber); }
    .sol-quote p { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 1rem; font-style: italic; }
    .sol-quote cite { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-style: normal; font-weight: 600; }

    .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
    .stat-card { padding: 2rem 1rem; }
    .stat-num { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .stat-num--amber { color: var(--amber-dark); }
    .stat-label { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .stat-sub { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

    .cross-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .cross-card {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
        background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
        text-decoration: none; transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .cross-card:hover { border-color: var(--amber); box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(217,119,6,0.1); }
    .cross-icon { font-size: 1.75rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .cross-card div { flex: 1; }
    .cross-card strong { display: block; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
    .cross-card span { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .cross-arrow { color: var(--text-muted); flex-shrink: 0; }

    .sol-cta { padding: 5rem 2rem; background: var(--surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: center; }
    .sol-cta-inner { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .sol-cta h2 { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
    .sol-cta p { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0 0 2rem; }
    .sol-cta-buttons { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    .btn-primary {
        background: var(--teal); color: #FFFFFF; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 0.8rem 1.75rem;
        border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--teal-dark); }
    .btn-secondary {
        background: var(--white); color: var(--text); font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 0.8rem 1.75rem;
        border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none;
        border: 1px solid var(--border); transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--teal); background: var(--teal-light); }

    @@media (max-width: 640px) {
        .sol-feat-grid, .pain-grid, .cross-grid, .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
</style>
